## Configuration

| Variable | Default | Meaning |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `AAAS_SERVICE` | `__SERVICE__` | Service name used in logs, metrics and Consul |
| `AAAS_ENV` | `local` | Environment name sent to config-server |
| `AAAS_BOOTSTRAP` | `env` | `env` (read env vars) or `platform` (config-server + OpenBao) |
| `AAAS_HTTP_PORT` | `8080` | HTTP port |
| `AAAS_GRPC_PORT` | `9090` | gRPC port |
| `__SERVICE_UPPER___DB_PASSWORD` | `change-me` | Database password (moves to OpenBao in P5.3) |

