## Running and testing

```sh
make build-__SERVICE__   # image through Compose (root Makefile)
make test-__SERVICE__    # unit tests in the Dockerfile `test` stage
make lint-__SERVICE__    # formatter check and linter in the `lint` stage
make fmt-__SERVICE__     # format sources in place
make doc-coverage-__SERVICE__  # native documentation coverage (100%)
make api-docs-__SERVICE__      # native API docs to build/api-docs/__SERVICE__
make logs SVC=__SERVICE__
```

From this directory: `make help`.

